A module, class or session fixture runs once per worker, inside whichever test needs it first, so coverage recorded its code under that one test. The recorder plugin now runs each such fixture, both halves, under a coverage context of its own and records which tests used it; the selection index gives those rows to every user. Rows nobody is recorded using are stored as run under no test, so the selector does not narrow on them. The by-statement selector still only records. Addresses WI-zimiv-doguz-zabad-pivof-hupas-dutuh-kimol-fadas. Not covered: a shared fixture fetched by name inside another shared fixture that was already built on that worker.
